%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f3ee17fdcd09b15409e5287b9dba6051, type: 3}
  m_Name: PipLines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastSignal.Core::LastSignal.PipLineSet
  entries:
  - missionId: M1
    intro:
    - I am Pip. I keep the count so you do not have to.
    - Build a test frame on the sled. Pick an engine and only the payload this test
      needs, lock the clamps, then fire. Watch a = F / m.
    failHint: Mass fights thrust. Check the numbers before the next test.
  - missionId: M2
    intro:
    - Your son's flight assessment is in the records. It was never in his briefing.
    - Open it, then fix the plan in the Mission Planner. Every check runs against
      the plan you apply.
    failHint: One copy of each part is not enough. Add a spare where the failures
      hurt most.
  - missionId: M3
    intro:
    - A relay satellite is in your path. It will be destroyed.
    - Something is coming up behind us. It is not on any chart.
    failHint: You cannot fix everything. Repair what keeps you alive first.
  - missionId: M4
    intro:
    - The scanner found a planet with water.
    - Pick your landing site with care. Slope, rocks and ice all matter.
    failHint: Look at the slope and the rocks before you pick a site. Water is nearby.
  - missionId: Final
    intro:
    - The survey is ready. Home is listening.
    - Open the channel. Say what you found.
    failHint: Raise the antenna and align it before you transmit.
  - missionId: DesignMode
    intro:
    - Now it is your turn. Design any mission you like.
    - Pick subsystems, add redundancy, and watch the success probability move.
    failHint: Start with the cheapest change that raises the gauge the most.
